    "longBusinessSummary": "SMS Co., Ltd. provides information infrastructure for the nursing care, medical care, career, healthcare, and elderly care field business areas in Japan and internationally. The company provides career services such as Web community for nurses/nursing students, Job information for nursing students, recruiting agent service(RAG) for nurses, midwives, radiological and medical technologists, clinical engineers, public health nurses, registered dietitians, care workers, PT/OT/ST, childcare workers, therapists, care managers, social workers, and disability care workers; workplace assessment tool for nurses; school for workers in the elderly care field; information service on qualification courses for elderly care; media platform; cross-occupational direct recruiting; scholarship information for high school students/nursing students; and web community for registered dietitians. It also offers elderly/disability care services such as management support for elderly/disability care operators, information portal for the management of home-visit nursing care operators and elderly care operators, research and information on the aging society, and business support for disability care operators; and healthcare services offers remote specific and industrial health services, remote preventive solution for lifestyle-related diseases, RAG for persons with disabilities, information portal of industrial health service, stress checks specialized for medical care and elderly care industries, and solution for balancing work with family care. In addition, the company offers senior life services such as web community for people struggling with elderly care and care managers, referral service of renovation operators, housing for the elderly, home-delivered meals, funeral companies; RAG for construction and real estate industry; and medical information for healthcare professionals. SMS Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2003 and is based in Tokyo, Japan.",
